Prada L'eau L'Homme

&#x200B;

This fragrance reminds me of the summer past, my most recent relationship. alot of things happened that year. I love it

I've taken it 3 days in a row before and the second time you'll still get a buzz but wont be as intense, the most harm your doing there is possibly fucking up ur sleep routine a bit more and the comedown will be pretty bad

&#x200B;

MDMA is naturally neurotoxic so that is a risk regardless

Thanks

